# 行尾与二进制保护（根治 skill/扩展双副本 CRLF/LF 漂移假象；双副本纪律见根 AGENTS.md 约定 2）
# 文本：入库统一 LF，检出一律 LF（Windows 下 VSCode/Git Bash/Next.js 均无碍）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专属脚本保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# ---- 二进制：禁止任何行尾转换与文本 diff ----
*.bin  binary
*.gba  binary
*.sav  binary
*.ss1  binary
*.bmp  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
*.7z   binary
*.xz   binary
*.wasm binary
*.node binary
